  "title": "SIP1.5: Cross-chain Fleet Deployment: LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC on mainnet",
  "description": "# SIP1.5: Cross-chain Fleet Deployment: LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to activate the LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nThis cross-chain fleet deployment will expand the protocol's capabilities across multiple networks.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n- Buffer Ark: 0xEB60A8e747d73c58cCc320bcdAbB166F8A0C0D9D\n- Number of Arks: 11\n- Curator: 0xa16f07B4Dd32250DEc69C63eCd0aef6CD6096d3d\n\n### Token Bridge\n- Amount: 3,458,333 tokens (3458333000000000000000000 raw)\n- Destination: Mainnet - Treasury (SummerTimelock) 0x447BF9d1485ABDc4C1778025DfdfbE8b894C3796\n\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Bridge 3,458,333 (3458333000000000000000000 raw) tokens to the target chain\n2. Add Fleet to Harbor Command\n3. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for BufferArk\n4. Add 11 Arks to the Fleet\n5. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n6. Grant CURATOR_ROLE to Curator for the Fleet\n7. Set up rewards for 1 tokens\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n### Fleet Configuration\n- Deposit Cap: 0 (100000000 raw)\n- Initial Minimum Buffer Balance: 0 (0 raw)\n- Initial Rebalance Cooldown: 1 hour (3600 seconds)\n- Initial Tip Rate: 1% (10000000000000000 raw)\n\n### Rewards Configuration\n- Reward Tokens: 0x194f360D130F2393a5E9F3117A6a1B78aBEa1624\n- Reward Amounts: 3,458,333 tokens (3458333000000000000000000)\n- Rewards Duration: 83 days (7171200 seconds)\n",
